{"vid":"hJxBdRYm81I","source":"hJxBdRYm81I.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":3.5,"txt":"Our focus isn't making money and profiting off the stuff"},{"t":6.7,"txt":"we remove. It's distributing it out to people that need"},{"t":9.9,"txt":"it so that our customers want to hire us more because"},{"t":13.3,"txt":"they know that their stuff isn't being just thrown in"},{"t":15.6,"txt":"the dump. But then we're also giving back to people"},{"t":18,"txt":"in need. We want to build futures for our friends,"},{"t":20.9,"txt":"and we want to do what we love and not have to work at"},{"t":24.1,"txt":"a job that we hate ever again."},{"t":27.5,"txt":"I'm Kirk and I'm 22 years old."},{"t":29.9,"txt":"And I'm his brother Jacob, and I'm 20 years old."},{"t":32.5,"txt":"Here's how we turned our high school side hustle into"},{"t":35.8,"txt":"a junk collecting business that brought in $3 million"},{"t":39,"txt":"in 2025."},{"t":45.4,"txt":"In 2021, we started Junk Teens with just my brother"},{"t":48.6,"txt":"and I. I was a freshman in high school."},{"t":50.7,"txt":"He was a junior. And now 2026,"},{"t":53.7,"txt":"we have five trucks, a sixth truck on the way,"},{"t":57.1,"txt":"and a team of about 25 employees."},{"t":61,"txt":"Junk Teens junk removal is a junk removal company based"},{"t":64.4,"txt":"out of Norwood, Massachusetts."},{"t":66.3,"txt":"We're a group of teenagers and college students that"},{"t":69.9,"txt":"remove junk. And we properly dispose of those items by"},{"t":75,"txt":"bringing them to transfer stations,"},{"t":76.7,"txt":"bringing them back to our warehouse,"},{"t":78.4,"txt":"reselling, donating, and doing our best to keep"},{"t":81.3,"txt":"items out of the landfill."},{"t":82.9,"txt":"And in 2025, we completed over 5,500 jobs."},{"t":101.8,"txt":"Before Junk Teens, we never knew that we wanted"},{"t":105,"txt":"to be business owners or entrepreneurs."},{"t":107.4,"txt":"It's a beautiful, sunny Massachusetts morning."},{"t":119.7,"txt":"So after doing that for about a year,"},{"t":121.4,"txt":"I had saved up some money."},{"t":122.9,"txt":"Jake had a little bit of money,"},{"t":124.3,"txt":"and we kind of realized throughout that time,"},{"t":127.7,"txt":"just me being at the dump, that people would pay us to"},{"t":130.4,"txt":"take their junk to the dump."},{"t":132.5,"txt":"That's when I was like, all right, I can't do this"},{"t":134.3,"txt":"alone. I need to team up with somebody."},{"t":136.5,"txt":"That's when Jacob came into the picture,"},{"t":138.3,"txt":"and it was pretty short after that,"},{"t":140.7,"txt":"where we bought our first pickup truck for $4,000."},{"t":144.4,"txt":"We never knew we wanted it to be some big company."},{"t":147.3,"txt":"We didn't even know what our niche was."},{"t":149.3,"txt":"It was K and J removal, but we were doing"},{"t":151.3,"txt":"landscaping, moving, junk removal like anything"},{"t":154.7,"txt":"we could with that pickup truck to make money in the"},{"t":156.8,"txt":"first year. But then we realized if we want this to"},{"t":159.3,"txt":"be big, we need to niche down and pick something that"},{"t":162.3,"txt":"we become the best at."},{"t":163.6,"txt":"And we realized out of all things,"},{"t":165.4,"txt":"junk removal was the most competitive."},{"t":167.5,"txt":"But I saw that as the most scalable opportunity."},{"t":170.3,"txt":"And honestly, it was the most fun out of"},{"t":172.3,"txt":"everything and I felt like it was the most profitable."},{"t":175.2,"txt":"Some businesses and some industries, of course, have"},{"t":177.3,"txt":"certain catalysts that change the business"},{"t":179.1,"txt":"overnight. But for a service based business and for at"},{"t":181.8,"txt":"least what we were doing, that was never the case. It"},{"t":183.6,"txt":"was just slow, extremely consistent growth"},{"t":185.7,"txt":"all the time."},{"t":186.6,"txt":"We reinvested everything back in in our second year,"},{"t":189.8,"txt":"and we bought our first dump truck with all the money"},{"t":192.2,"txt":"that we made in our first year."},{"t":202.6,"txt":"We've never financed our trucks."},{"t":205.2,"txt":"We've never invested over what we were capable of"},{"t":208.8,"txt":"getting in cash."},{"t":210,"txt":"Our strategy was to run things lean and pay in full"},{"t":213.1,"txt":"for everything and grow slow and steady and own"},{"t":216.5,"txt":"everything. And that's exactly what we did."},{"t":218.9,"txt":"And I think it was really like the second year when we"},{"t":221.7,"txt":"started to be able to pay ourselves."},{"t":225.2,"txt":"All right, you can put your end down."},{"t":228.6,"txt":"We've always been profitable and essentially debt-free"},{"t":231.3,"txt":"since the beginning."},{"t":232.4,"txt":"The biggest business expense is definitely labor."},{"t":234.7,"txt":"In the very beginning, obviously,"},{"t":236.4,"txt":"we were pretty slow, so if we only had one job a"},{"t":239.5,"txt":"week, it would only take us an hour. We could totally do"},{"t":241.4,"txt":"it after school or on a weekend."},{"t":243.1,"txt":"But when things really started to get busy, this"},{"t":245.1,"txt":"was probably around like my sophomore year,"},{"t":247.3,"txt":"Kirk's senior year, and we were doing jobs like"},{"t":249.3,"txt":"every day. It became like a whole challenge of like,"},{"t":252.6,"txt":"how do we do this stuff?"},{"t":254,"txt":"At that time, I was dealing with all the"},{"t":255.8,"txt":"customers. I had to figure out how much we were pricing"},{"t":258.3,"txt":"these jobs at. And obviously,"},{"t":260.1,"txt":"like when we were going to fit them in the schedule."},{"t":261.7,"txt":"And the trickiest part was we were in school during all"},{"t":265.4,"txt":"of the hours that the dumps were always open."},{"t":277.5,"txt":"Because we were transparent and we told people what we"},{"t":280.8,"txt":"were doing. I feel like we had a little bit more"},{"t":283.2,"txt":"flexibility sometimes, but there were 100% times"},{"t":286.4,"txt":"where like, I think I got detention one time because I"},{"t":289.3,"txt":"was late so many times for school because of like"},{"t":292.3,"txt":"having to dump the truck in the beginning,"},{"t":294.2,"txt":"like there were a lot of sacrifices we made and some"},{"t":296.8,"txt":"sleepless nights as well."},{"t":298.6,"txt":"And you're going to school the next day on like maybe"},{"t":301,"txt":"three hours of sleep."},{"t":302.2,"txt":"But that's kind of what it takes if you want to do"},{"t":304.9,"txt":"something extraordinary or different."},{"t":307.5,"txt":"Our weekends were fully packed."},{"t":309.1,"txt":"We would be doing jobs every Saturday and Sunday,"},{"t":311.6,"txt":"especially in our second year. Once we really started"},{"t":313.7,"txt":"to build up the business, I would say for the first"},{"t":316.1,"txt":"two years, it was really hard for us too because we"},{"t":319.1,"txt":"were working out of our parent's driveway."},{"t":321.1,"txt":"We would basically like take some of the stuff that we"},{"t":323.9,"txt":"would get and like put it in the corner of the driveway"},{"t":325.9,"txt":"and put a tarp over it."},{"t":327,"txt":"And if we did sell stuff, we would have to sell it"},{"t":329.1,"txt":"like the next day on Facebook."},{"t":330.6,"txt":"And it's kind of hard to find a buyer sometimes."},{"t":332.6,"txt":"But eventually we outgrew our parent's driveway"},{"t":335,"txt":"because we were getting another truck,"},{"t":336.7,"txt":"so we were going to have three."},{"t":338.1,"txt":"There were so many good resellable items that we"},{"t":340.3,"txt":"didn't want to like, throw them away."},{"t":341.8,"txt":"And that's when we actually ended up renting the"},{"t":344.1,"txt":"warehouse that we're in right now."},{"t":345.6,"txt":"And this place when we first moved in was just all run"},{"t":348.9,"txt":"down and it was just so dirty."},{"t":356.5,"txt":"This place is one of the biggest things that allowed"},{"t":358.5,"txt":"us to repurpose a lot of the junk and resell it,"},{"t":361.6,"txt":"and donate too."},{"t":362.9,"txt":"Me and Kirk haven't been in the field for probably two"},{"t":366.1,"txt":"full years. If anything, maybe even more than that,"},{"t":368.1,"txt":"none of us are really involved with the day to day"},{"t":370.1,"txt":"operation too much besides just overseeing things."},{"t":372.5,"txt":"All right, we'll start this thing up."},{"t":381.9,"txt":"All right."},{"t":386.5,"txt":"I thought I was going to drop out at least three"},{"t":389,"txt":"times already."},{"t":390,"txt":"And college is really difficult,"},{"t":391.9,"txt":"especially when owning a business."},{"t":393.7,"txt":"One of the biggest things for us is that we're doing"},{"t":395.8,"txt":"it for our parents because we trust them."},{"t":398.3,"txt":"But also through being in college now,"},{"t":401.1,"txt":"for almost four years myself,"},{"t":403.1,"txt":"I've come to realize that college has taught me things"},{"t":405.9,"txt":"that business never will."},{"t":407.6,"txt":"And life isn't all about making money and having a"},{"t":410.8,"txt":"successful business, because there are a lot of"},{"t":413.1,"txt":"other aspects of life that will make somebody a"},{"t":416.2,"txt":"well-rounded person and successful in other areas."},{"t":420.1,"txt":"We want to make that next big step for the company"},{"t":422.7,"txt":"within the next couple of years."},{"t":424.3,"txt":"We want to grow beyond this location,"},{"t":427.1,"txt":"whether it's privately owned locations or a different"},{"t":430.2,"txt":"model to scale the business,"},{"t":431.8,"txt":"whether it's franchising, licensing."},{"t":433.6,"txt":"There's many different ways that we can scale from here."},{"t":445.3,"txt":"We're aiming for 5 million in sales,"},{"t":447.1,"txt":"and obviously we're going to need a bigger team. So we"},{"t":449.1,"txt":"have more employees on standby."},{"t":451,"txt":"We're really just kind of growing things as we go."},{"t":453,"txt":"We want to create opportunities for people,"},{"t":455.5,"txt":"but we also want to give back because the world's"},{"t":457.9,"txt":"given to us. And this year we're really focusing on"},{"t":461.2,"txt":"making more donation partner connections."},{"t":464.2,"txt":"I think when we moved to college,"},{"t":465.9,"txt":"it kind of unlocked a new level of growth for the"},{"t":468.2,"txt":"business because of that extra time and freedom that"},{"t":470.6,"txt":"we did have. But I have a really strong feeling that"},{"t":472.9,"txt":"after college, things are going to take off"},{"t":474.9,"txt":"more than they ever have."}],"words":[{"t":3.48,"w":"Our"},{"t":3.48,"w":"focus"},{"t":3.48,"w":"isn't"},{"t":3.48,"w":"making"},{"t":3.48,"w":"money"},{"t":3.48,"w":"and"},{"t":3.48,"w":"profiting"},{"t":3.48,"w":"off"},{"t":3.48,"w":"the"},{"t":3.48,"w":"stuff"},{"t":6.72,"w":"we"},{"t":6.72,"w":"remove."},{"t":6.72,"w":"It's"},{"t":6.72,"w":"distributing"},{"t":6.72,"w":"it"},{"t":6.72,"w":"out"},{"t":6.72,"w":"to"},{"t":6.72,"w":"people"},{"t":6.72,"w":"that"},{"t":6.72,"w":"need"},{"t":9.92,"w":"it"},{"t":9.92,"w":"so"},{"t":9.92,"w":"that"},{"t":9.92,"w":"our"},{"t":9.92,"w":"customers"},{"t":9.92,"w":"want"},{"t":9.92,"w":"to"},{"t":9.92,"w":"hire"},{"t":9.92,"w":"us"},{"t":9.92,"w":"more"},{"t":9.92,"w":"because"},{"t":13.28,"w":"they"},{"t":13.28,"w":"know"},{"t":13.28,"w":"that"},{"t":13.28,"w":"their"},{"t":13.28,"w":"stuff"},{"t":13.28,"w":"isn't"},{"t":13.28,"w":"being"},{"t":13.28,"w":"just"},{"t":13.28,"w":"thrown"},{"t":13.28,"w":"in"},{"t":15.56,"w":"the"},{"t":15.56,"w":"dump."},{"t":15.56,"w":"But"},{"t":15.56,"w":"then"},{"t":15.56,"w":"we're"},{"t":15.56,"w":"also"},{"t":15.56,"w":"giving"},{"t":15.56,"w":"back"},{"t":15.56,"w":"to"},{"t":15.56,"w":"people"},{"t":18.04,"w":"in"},{"t":18.04,"w":"need."},{"t":18.04,"w":"We"},{"t":18.04,"w":"want"},{"t":18.04,"w":"to"},{"t":18.04,"w":"build"},{"t":18.04,"w":"futures"},{"t":18.04,"w":"for"},{"t":18.04,"w":